# =============================================================================
# Publication policy: CODE ONLY (while research is unvalidated).
#
# This repository publishes the software layer: the reusable Python package,
# tests, research notebooks, and the configuration needed to run them.
#
# It deliberately EXCLUDES, and keeps local only:
#   - All documentation, method notes, and planning docs (*.md, except this
#     repo's root README.md)
#   - All research data (the entire data/ tree)
#   - All generated outputs, maps, reports, and media (the entire outputs/ tree)
#   - All reference materials (pitch deck, brief, proposals, images)
#
# These are sensitive until the research and ideas are validated. The README
# will be expanded once the evidence base is credible.
# =============================================================================

# --- Virtual environments ---
.bkqproj/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Package / tooling caches ---
.uv-cache/
.uv-python/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
cache/
*/cache/
pytest-of-*/
tmp*_kernels/

# --- Local environment files ---
.env
.env.*

# --- Documentation & notes: sensitive, keep local. No READMEs are published;
#     the GitHub repo keeps its own placeholder README. ---
*.md

# --- Reference materials & media: keep local ---
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.docx
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.svg
image/

# --- Research data & generated outputs: keep local ---
phase1_spinelens_ai/data/
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/

# Defensive: never publish spatial/data artifacts wherever they appear
*.geojson
*.gpkg
*.graphml
*.parquet
*.zip
*.html

# --- Frontend / build outputs ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/

# --- OS and editor files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# =============================================================================
# Selective output publication: generated CHARTS (PNG) and MAPS (HTML) only.
# Everything else under outputs/ stays local: notes (*.md), tables (CSV),
# executed notebooks, deck-derived media, and AI/concept images.
# =============================================================================
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/maps/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/maps/*.html
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/gate0b_audit_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/gate0b_audit_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/route_legibility_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/route_legibility_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/wayfinder_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/wayfinder_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/crossing_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/crossing_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/corridor_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/corridor_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/wayfinder_content_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/wayfinder_content_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/pavilion_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/pavilion_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/budget_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/budget_media/*.png
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/evidence_pack_media/
!phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/evidence_pack_media/*.png

# Re-assert exclusions for everything else inside the re-included output dirs:
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/tables/
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/exports/
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/*.ipynb
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/concept_visuals/
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/correct_deck_extract/
phase1_spinelens_ai/outputs/reports/pptx_slide7_media/
